_pdbx_database_remark.id     999 
_pdbx_database_remark.text   
;SEQUENCE 
Ser 65 in the database has been mutated to alanine, Tyr  
66 in the database has been mutated to serine. Residues  
Ala 65, Ser 66 and Gly 67 consitute the chromophore  
CRW 66. This ligand underwent denaturation-induced 
backbone fragmentation between the C1 and CA1 atoms 
resulting in fragmented CRW ligand and an E1H molecule
;
